### Purge or let it expire?

```dot
digraph purge_or_expire {
    "Key's source data changed" [shape=box];
    "Stale value until TTL ends gives a wrong or unsafe result?" [shape=diamond];
    "Remaining TTL short enough that the harm is acceptable?" [shape=diamond];
    "Let it expire" [shape=box];
    "Purge the key" [shape=box];

    "Key's source data changed" -> "Stale value until TTL ends gives a wrong or unsafe result?";
    "Stale value until TTL ends gives a wrong or unsafe result?" -> "Let it expire" [label="no"];
    "Stale value until TTL ends gives a wrong or unsafe result?" -> "Remaining TTL short enough that the harm is acceptable?" [label="yes"];
    "Remaining TTL short enough that the harm is acceptable?" -> "Let it expire" [label="yes"];
    "Remaining TTL short enough that the harm is acceptable?" -> "Purge the key" [label="no"];
}
```
